  Description: You live behind the controls of a vehicle, and can handle anything
    the road or waves and sky can throw at you. You adventure to test your skills
    with new and interesting vehicles. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Strength or Dexterity , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in
    the Acrobatics skill and either the Driving Lore or Piloting Lore skill. You
    gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance] skill feat with the
    chosen lore.
